  "title": "Could: умел, мог бы",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "**Could** — прошлое от can: «умел, мог». When I was five I **could** swim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "И вежливая просьба, мягче, чем can: **Could you** help me, please? **Could I** have the bill?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tip",
      "md": "Couldn't — «не мог»: I couldn't sleep last night."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "Форма",
        "Пример"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
